WEBVTT

00:00:59.447 --> 00:01:03.522
Pastaj kemi po te njejtat tipe, 
por me leter te ricikluar,

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:08.035
dhe sigurisht prej ketyre duhet te marresh pese,
sepse ato nuk thithin mire.

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:14.556
E verteta eshte se ti mund t'ia dalesh 
me nje leter te vetme.

00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:16.596
Celesi? Dy fjale:

00:01:16.596 --> 00:01:21.044
Gjysma ketej e dhomes, fjala juaj eshte "shkund".

00:01:21.044 --> 00:01:23.226
Thuajeni fort. Shkund. Me fort.

00:01:23.226 --> 00:01:24.771
Publiku: Shkund

00:01:24.771 --> 00:01:26.947
Joe Smith: Fjala juaj eshte "palos"

00:01:26.947 --> 00:01:28.063
Publiku: Palos

00:01:28.063 --> 00:01:28.990
JS: Edhe nje here.

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:31.059
Publiku: Palos. JS: Me fort.